    "Comment": "Values reported are geometric means and 1 SD ranges for serum ferritin (µg/L) at Year 2. Females: Fortified geometric mean = 27 (SD range 10-73), Control geometric mean = 19 (SD range 6-55). Males: Fortified geometric mean = 56 (SD range 20-159), Control geometric mean = 39 (SD range 13-122). Repeated-measures ANOVA interaction between groups and annual measurements of serum ferritin in females showed F = 10.0, p < 0.01, and difference at 2 y was F = 13.8, p < 0.001. No ICC was reported for the family-based cluster randomization. Sample sizes from Table 2 at Year 2: Females Control n=161, Fortified n=164; Males Control n=139, Fortified n=134 (total N=598). Table 3 gives completed subjects as Females Control n=127, Fortified n=139; Males Control n=124, Fortified n=115. Overall 672 subjects remained at 2 y.; group_1/group_2 fields swapped: the extractor itself stated group_1_label ('Fortified masala (NaFe(III)EDTA)') is the intervention arm (group_1_is_control=False); N-INCONSISTENCY: n_control(161) + n_treatment(164) = 325 ≠ n_total(672) — verify per-group Ns",
